{"page":426,"verses":[{"verse_key":"33:55","surah":33,"ayah":55,"ar_uthmani":"لَّا جُنَاحَ عَلَيْهِنَّ فِىٓ ءَابَآئِهِنَّ وَلَآ أَبْنَآئِهِنَّ وَلَآ إِخْوَٰنِهِنَّ وَلَآ أَبْنَآءِ إِخْوَٰنِهِنَّ وَلَآ أَبْنَآءِ أَخَوَٰتِهِنَّ وَلَا نِسَآئِهِنَّ وَلَا مَا مَلَكَتْ أَيْمَـٰنُهُنَّ ۗ وَٱتَّقِينَ ٱللَّهَ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ كَانَ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ شَهِيدًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The Prophet’s wives are not to blame [if they are seen by] their fathers, their sons, their brothers, their brothers’ sons, their sisters’ sons, their women, or their slaves. [Wives of the Prophet], be mindful of God. God observes everything.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"(There is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"33:55"},{"pos":2,"ar":"جُنَاحَ","en_gloss":"blame","transliteration":"junāḥa","verse_key":"33:55"},{"pos":3,"ar":"عَلَيْهِنَّ","en_gloss":"upon them","transliteration":"ʿalayhinna","verse_key":"33:55"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"concerning","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"33:55"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَابَآئِهِنَّ","en_gloss":"their fathers","transliteration":"ābāihinna","verse_key":"33:55"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَآ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"33:55"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَبْنَآئِهِنَّ","en_gloss":"their sons","transliteration":"abnāihinna","verse_key":"33:55"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَآ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"33:55"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِخْوَٰنِهِنَّ","en_gloss":"their brothers","transliteration":"ikh'wānihinna","verse_key":"33:55"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَآ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"33:55"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَبْنَآءِ","en_gloss":"sons","transliteration":"abnāi","verse_key":"33:55"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِخْوَٰنِهِنَّ","en_gloss":"(of) their brothers","transliteration":"ikh'wānihinna","verse_key":"33:55"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَلَآ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"33:55"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَبْنَآءِ","en_gloss":"sons","transliteration":"abnāi","v