oss":"annoy","transliteration":"yu'dhūna","verse_key":"33:57"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"33:57"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūlahu","verse_key":"33:57"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَعَنَهُمُ","en_gloss":"Allah has cursed them","transliteration":"laʿanahumu","verse_key":"33:57"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has cursed them","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"33:57"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"33:57"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"33:57"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","en_gloss":"and the Hereafter","transliteration":"wal-ākhirati","verse_key":"33:57"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَأَعَدَّ","en_gloss":"and prepared","transliteration":"wa-aʿadda","verse_key":"33:57"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"33:57"},{"pos":13,"ar":"عَذَابًۭا","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","verse_key":"33:57"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مُّهِينًۭا","en_gloss":"humiliating","transliteration":"muhīnan","verse_key":"33:57"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٥٧","en_gloss":"(57)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"33:57"}]},{"verse_key":"33:58","surah":33,"ayah":58,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ يُؤْذُونَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ بِغَيْرِ مَا ٱكْتَسَبُوا۟ فَقَدِ ٱحْتَمَلُوا۟ بُهْتَـٰنًا وَإِثْمًا مُّبِينًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and those who undeservedly insult believing men and women will bear the guilt of slander and flagrant sin.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"33:58"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُؤْذُونَ","en_gloss":"harm","transliteration":"yu'dhūna","verse_key":"33:58"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the believing men","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"33:58"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"and the believing women","trans