We shall rouse you [Prophet] against them, and then they will only be your neighbours in this city for a short while.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ لَّئِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"la-in","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَنتَهِ","en_gloss":"cease","transliteration":"yantahi","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقُونَ","en_gloss":"the hypocrites","transliteration":"l-munāfiqūna","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"and those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قُلُوبِهِم","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbihim","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَّرَضٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) a disease","transliteration":"maraḍun","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱلْمُرْجِفُونَ","en_gloss":"and those who spread rumors","transliteration":"wal-mur'jifūna","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْمَدِينَةِ","en_gloss":"the city","transliteration":"l-madīnati","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَنُغْرِيَنَّكَ","en_gloss":"We will let you overpower them","transliteration":"lanugh'riyannaka","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِهِمْ","en_gloss":"We will let you overpower them","transliteration":"bihim","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يُجَاوِرُونَكَ","en_gloss":"they will remain your neighbors","transliteration":"yujāwirūnaka","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فِيهَآ","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":18,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"33:60"},{"pos":19,"ar":"قَلِيلًۭا","en_gloss":"(for)